# SIGTERM must END the daemon (the trap exits with 143 since the 2026-07-22 fix). Before
# the fix the trap cleaned up (lock removed, mutex released) and the loop KEPT RUNNING
# with its own gates opened — post-TERM sync cycles, reproduced live by this harness.
desc syncd: SIGTERM -> clean exit 143, no post-TERM loop
invoke syncd
timeout 8
termsig 1
charging on
config paired
wifi up
engine 0|RESULT pushed=1
expect_exit 143
